From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bjarne <87858321+bjakra@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 16:51:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Play Integrity: device fingerprint fetch, storage and
 settings

PlayFingerprint fetches the current Pixel 8 Pro Canary fingerprint from Google's
servers; FingerprintStore persists it per user and feeds it into GmsCompatConfig
(reparse + CONFIG_UPDATED pushes it live); FingerprintBootReceiver refreshes it
on boot when enabled. The Play Integrity keybox screen gains a "Device
fingerprint" section (enable switch, manual Update now, status). Adds INTERNET +
RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>

